39.563" end="00:39.783">And </span><span begin="00:39.783" end="00:40.033">though </span><span begin="00:40.033" end="00:40.313">she </span><span begin="00:40.313" end="00:40.563">says </span><span begin="00:40.563" end="00:40.783">she </span><span begin="00:40.783" end="00:42.733">does </span><span begin="00:42.733" end="00:42.963">and </span><span begin="00:42.963" end="00:43.143">hasnt </span><span begin="00:43.143" end="00:43.393">lost </span><span begin="00:43.393" end="00:43.703">your </span><span begin="00:43.703" end="00:43.923">trust</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.063" end="00:48.943"><span begin="00:46.063" end="00:46.373">Who </span><span begin="00:46.373" end="00:46.593">could </span><span begin="00:46.593" end="00:46.993">there </span><span begin="00:46.993" end="00:47.263">be </span><span begin="00:47.263" end="00:47.493">knockin </span><span begin="00:47.493" end="00:48.033">at </span><span begin="00:48.033" end="00:48.493">her </span><span begin="00:48.493" end="00:48.943">door</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.923" end="00:54.263"><span begin="00:52.923" end="00:53.193">Must </span><span begin="00:53.193" end="00:53.773">be </span><span begin="00:53.773" end="00:54.033">another </span><span begin="00:54.033" end="00:54.263">one</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.323" end="01:01.923"><span begin="00:59.323" end="00:59.713">Must </span><span begin="00:59.713" end="01:00.153">be </span><span begin="01:00.153" end="01:00.483">another </span><span begin="01:00.483" end="01:01.343">one </span><span begin="01:01.343" end="01:01.653">she </span><span begin="01:01.653" end="01:01.923">loves</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.813" end="01:07.403"><span begin="01:05.813" end="01:06.173">Must </span><span begin="01:06.173" end="01:06.813">be </span><span begin="01:06.813" end="01:07.103">another </span><span begin="01:07.103" end="01:07.403">one</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.483" end="01:14.733"><span begin="01:12.483" en